WEBVTT

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:00.776
called Dispensers for Safe Water.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:02.136
And I got involved.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:04.936
And I'm not expecting
the Nobel Prize committee

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.216
to knock down my door,

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:10.536
but it's a baby step,
it's a little something.

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:13.376
And it's all because of gratitude.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:16.936
And it's why I encourage
people, friends, family,

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.936
to follow gratitude trails of their own.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.776
Because it's a
life-transforming experience.

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:24.416
And it doesn't have to be coffee.

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:25.656
It could be anything.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:28.216
It could be a pair of socks,
it could be a light bulb.

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:31.816
And you don't have to go around the world,
you can just do a little gesture,